@startuml phantom-proxy
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam participantBorderThickness 2
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Phantom Proxy — Credentials Never Touch the Sandbox

box "🔒 Sandbox" #e8f4fd
    participant "🤖 Agent" as Agent
    note over Agent
        ENV:
        ""OPENAI_API_KEY = a3f7c9...random hex""
        ""OPENAI_BASE_URL = http://127.0.0.1:4096/phantom/openai""
    end note
end box

box "🛡️ OpenCode Supervisor" #e8f8f5
    participant "Phantom\nProxy" as Proxy
end box

box "☁️ Upstream" #f5f5f5
    participant "OpenAI API" as API
end box

actor "🏴‍☠️ Attacker" as Attacker #ff7675

== Normal Request Flow ==

Agent -> Proxy : POST /v1/chat/completions\nAuth: Bearer **a3f7c9...random**
activate Proxy

Proxy -> Proxy : 1. Verify phantom token (Map lookup)
Proxy -> Proxy : 2. Strip phantom token from headers
Proxy -> Proxy : 3. Inject **REAL** credential\n   from host environment

Proxy -> API : POST /v1/chat/completions\nAuth: Bearer **sk-prod-real-key-...**
activate API
API --> Proxy : 200 OK (streamed response)
deactivate API
Proxy --> Agent : 200 OK (forwarded)
deactivate Proxy

== Exfiltration Attempt ==

Agent -[#red,dashed]-> Attacker : exfiltrates env vars
note right of Attacker #636e72
    Stolen token: ""a3f7c9...random hex""
    ❌ Invalid outside local proxy
    ❌ Expires when session ends
    ❌ No relationship to real key ""sk-prod-...""
end note

note over Proxy #e8f8f5
    The **real credential** (""sk-prod-..."") only exists
    in the supervisor process. It never enters the
    sandbox's memory, environment, or process tree.
end note

@enduml
